<title>USA: Airways Corp Aug load drops to 61.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Airways Corp Aug load drops to 61.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>AIRTRAN AIRWAYS TRAFFIC RESULTS:</p>
<p>			    Aug'96		 Aug'95	 % Change</p>
<p>Passengers  :	  98,151		59,229	   +  66  %</p>
<p>ASMs  (000):	  138,363		78,631	   +  76  %</p>
<p>RPMs  (000):	   85,383		52,341	   +  63  %</p>
<p>Load Factor:	    61.7%		 66.6%	-  4.9 pts.</p>
<p>							Year-to-Date</p>
<p>					 8 months ended August 31, 1996</p>
<p>				 YTD 96	    YTD 95	 % Change</p>
<p>Passengers Carried:     762,558	 244,620	+  212 %</p>
<p>ASMs  (000):	    1,005,661	 370,891	+  171 %</p>
<p>RPMs  (000):		667,573	 224,665	+  197 %</p>
<p>Load Factor:		  66.4%	   60.6%	+  5.8 pts.</p>
